WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.150
Crouching light punch continues the opening light chain.

2
00:00:01.150 --> 00:00:01.850
Chun-Li cancels the standing jab into Drive Rush.

3
00:00:01.850 --> 00:00:02.450
Back heavy punch connects before the stance transition.

4
00:00:02.450 --> 00:00:02.900
Serenity Stream heavy kick launches Jamie.

5
00:00:02.900 --> 00:00:03.550
Jumping medium punch continues the airborne juggle.

6
00:00:03.550 --> 00:00:05.450
Heavy Aerial Hyakuretsukyaku connects after the delayed cancel.

7
00:00:05.450 --> 00:00:05.700
Jamie lands at the end of the air-Legs route.
